{"id":"u-07572472-a751-41a8-bab5-582923583323","src":"community","title":"Women’s Full Body Strength & Hypertrophy (1)","author":"Ellie Ferrell","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/G1lX8U-womens-full-body-strength-and-hypertrophy-1","desc":"Build muscle with this upper/lower workout for women. It combines lower rep ranges with higher rep ranges on both upper & lower days to maximize your results!\n\nEach week you should focus on increasing weight when appropriate in order to progress. For example, if you feel that you could do more than 6 reps with your working bench press weight, add 2.5-5lbs. If you feel you could do more than 12 reps with your goblet squat weight, add 2.5-5lbs. \n\nPICK A WEIGHT that is challenging, but not impossible, for the respective rep ranges. \n\nInclude a warm-up and cool-down of your own choice before and after each session. And remember - YOU CAN DO THIS!","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":37,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-28T22:58:24.077Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper - Strength","Lower - Strength","Rest - Cardio of Choice","Upper - Hypertrophy","Lower - Hypertrophy"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Dumbbell Row","sets":[{"r":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Chin-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":60}],"note":"Hold as long as you can"},{"n":"Hyperextension","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}],"note":"Glute focused"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Reverse Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Hip Thrust (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Walk","sets":[{"sec":1800}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n"